      "writtenOn": "2025-03-19T23:54:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we extract the apex at execution time and then build the apkcerts.txt from the extracted apks? It appears that\u0027s what app sets do, with the extract_apks tool.",
      "revId": "3778add0753f1dbe293b2026fb15d7c959df5d07",
